  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "航太英文",
    "sub_ename": "PROFESSIONAL ENGLISH IN AEROSPACE",
    "describe_ch": "航太的專業英語是指定給航太系大二到大四生的必修課程，課程結合了基本航太工程知識及英文，因此，可幫助修課學生提高他們的英文和航太基本知識，例如飛行的原理，飛機的結構，飛行過程中的基本對話和廣播等等。在本課程中，學生亦必需閱讀專業航太/機械領域之英文短篇、欣賞數部英文短片，含載人動力飛行的先軀-Wright brother生平及火箭發展史，訓練學生們的初級英文聽力。同時，在本課程中將傳授學生們航太專業相關詞彙和單字、基礎英文文法和英文寫作等。在教學方面，本課程將應用傳統以及互動式教學等技巧，包括以投影片講課、個別指導、實例介紹及影音教學。本課程對於學生畢業後，無論是上研究所繼續進修或是投入航太/機械工業職場之發展都將深具重要性，更可使學生與國際接軌，具國際競爭力，真正成為地球村的一員。",
    "describe_eh": "“Professional English in Aerospace” is intended as a required course for sophomore to senior students who major in Aerospace. It is a course that combines the English with basic aerospace engineering, and thus, will help students improve their English as well as their fundamental knowledge in aerospace, such as the principle of flight, the structure of airplane, basic in-flight conversation and announcement etc. In the course, students are also provided with a foundation of reading short English professional articles in Aeronautical/mechanical engineering and mechanics and watching few short video movies, including the frontier of powered flight and the frontier of rocket flight to train students’ basic listening abilities. Meanwhile, students can learn the professional vocabulary and terminology, basic English grammar, and English writing format in aerospace through the study of this course. In the classes, both traditional and interactive teaching skills are applied, including lecture tutorials, practical assignments and English audio/video teaching. This course is of great importance for students to develop their future career in graduate study or professional career in aerospace industry after graduation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
